- Itu sebabnya kami di sini.

231
00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:51.253
Hummer biru tua. Anda mengerti?

232
00:11:53.296 --> 00:11:54.422
Tunggu sebentar.

233
00:11:54.423 --> 00:11:56.757
Anda benar-benar tidak ingat
dimana kamu memarkir mobilmu?

234
00:11:56.758 --> 00:11:58.676
