258
00:13:17.589 --> 00:13:20.424
- Alex, tidak!
- Apakah kamu mencoba membuat dirimu terbunuh?

259
00:13:20.425 --> 00:13:22.676
Apa yang sedang kamu lakukan? Tidak, Seo Jin Wook!

260
00:13:22.677 --> 00:13:24.136
- [berteriak]
- Masuk!

261
00:13:24.137 --> 00:13:26.931
- Persetan! Dengarkan aku. Masuk ke sana.
- TIDAK!

262
00:13:26.932 --> 00:13:28.682
[Young-joo menangis]

263
00:13:28.683 --> 00:13:30.101
[Tripeater menangis]

264
00:13:31.811 --> 00:13:33.187
- [Young-joo] Alex.
- Persetan!

265
00:13:33.188 --> 00:13:35.649
- [kaca pecah]
- [Tripeater] Alex. Alex.

266
00:13:37.734 --> 00:13:39.401
[Young-joo menangis]

267
