294
00:15:16.291 --> 00:15:18.168
Mengerti? Ayo pergi.

295
00:15:21.338 --> 00:15:24.673
[terengah-engah] Kim Young-man,
Kwak Gye-young, buka.

296
00:15:24.674 --> 00:15:25.884
- Ya pak, segera.
- Segera!

297
00:15:29.346 --> 00:15:31.347
Jangan tembak sampai aku bilang begitu,
apakah aku mengerti?

298
00:15:31.348 --> 00:15:32.431
[semua] Menahan api.

299
00:15:32.432 --> 00:15:35.644
- Sekarang beralih ke ledakan singkat.
- [semua] Beralih ke ledakan singkat.

300
00:15:36.269 --> 00:15:38.396
Saya akan menghitung sampai tiga. Satu...

301
00:15:39.689 --> 00:15:40.690
Dua...

302
00:15:42.359 --> 00:15:43.359
Tiga.

303
00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.445
[musik yang mendebarkan diputar]

304
00:15:46.446 --> 00:15:48.656
- [In-ho merintih]
- [Jae-yoon] Ya Tuhan. Apa--

305
00:15:48.657 --> 00:15:51.283
[Soo-jeong] Oh, itu busuk.
Apa itu?

306
00:15:51.284 --> 00:15:54.037
- [semua tumpang tindih, berseru]
- [In-ho] Apa-apaan ini?

307
00:15:54.496 --> 00:15:55.579
[geram zombie]

308
00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:57.457
- [semua berteriak]
- [Tae-hwa] Tembak!

309
00:15:58.541 --> 00:16:00.918
[semua berteriak, tumpang tindih]

310
00:16:00.919 --> 00:16:03.253
- [Soo-jeong] Ya ampun.
- [In-ho] Tembak!

311
00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:06.799
[Jae-yoon] Oh, awas!
Itu masih bergerak. Astaga, sial.

312
00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.050
[In-ho] Tembak!

313
00:16:08.051 --> 00:16:10.136
[musik termenung diputar]

314
00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:25.151
[Tripeater terisak-isak]

315
00:16:34.160 --> 00:16:35.161
[mendengus]

316
00:16:36.579 --> 00:16:38.164
[menangis]

317
00:16:52.554 --> 00:16:53.555
Hai!

318
00:16:54.556 --> 00:16:56.181
Sepertinya mobilnya tidak ada di sini,

319
00:16:56.182 --> 00:16:58.392
