dan cari di tempat lain!

320
00:16:58.393 --> 00:16:59.561
[Tripeater mencemooh]

321
00:17:03.565 --> 00:17:04.732
Apa?

322
00:17:04.733 --> 00:17:06.985
- Wah, wah, wah, wah.
- [Young-joo berteriak]

323
00:17:08.611 --> 00:17:10.947
[mencemooh] Kamu pengecut.

324
00:17:12.949 --> 00:17:14.533
Apakah kamu gila, brengsek?

325
00:17:14.534 --> 00:17:16.827
aku akan keluar
dan merobek wajahmu.

326
00:17:16.828 --> 00:17:19.914
Aku akan membuangmu sepenuhnya
melintasi garasi parkir.

327
00:17:21.124 --> 00:17:23.375
Oh, tidak... Apa yang harus aku lakukan?

328
00:17:23.376 --> 00:17:25.253
Kamu beruntung aku--

329
00:17:28.089 --> 00:17:29.631
Pergi saja ke sana,

330
00:17:29.632 --> 00:17:32.593
