410
00:21:57.066 --> 00:21:59.901
- Haruskah aku memakai sabuk pengaman?
- [Jin-wook] <i>Terserah. Cepat.</i>

411
00:21:59.902 --> 00:22:01.446
- [Young-joo] <i>Pakai.</i>
- Oke.

412
00:22:02.822 --> 00:22:05.741
